//CTP Editor Structure file
//For more detailed comments see advance.ces

0.3 //Version number

#%047%047	//Comment charachter in data file
%032%009	//Delimiter charachters in data file
		// (use %nnn for ASCII ref)
:		//Break on right quasi-delimiter
}{		//Break on left quasi-delimiter

1 //Format

f //Whether this has a number at the top (num of fields)
f //Whether this has a tree structure
f //Whether this file references GL entries
f //Whether this file has entries in gl_str.txt
f //Whether this file is the GL icon file
f //Whether this structure file describes formatting of fields
  // (i.e. whether it has the LBF and LAF columns below)

//Name			Comp	PByDef	AMult	NumArgs
	//Type		DefaultValue	Comment
Duration		t	t	f	1
	0		20		Amount of time, in turns, for this Feat to last 
Description		t	t	f	1
	0		str_ldl_0	Unused String ID. This must be a valid String ID but is not actually used in the game. 
EffectBoatMovement	f	f	f	1
	0		100		Amount to increase movement of naval vessels. NOTE: Movement across one tile equals 100. 
EffectCityDefenseBonus	f	f	f	1
	0		10		Amount to add to Defense attribute of units garrisoned within a city. 
EffectReduceCityWalls	f	f	f	1
	0		-5		Amount to reduce effectiveness of enemy City Walls 
EffectIncreaseCityVision	f	f	f	1
	0		1		Amount to increase vision radius of cities 
EffectIncreaseProduction	f	f	f	1
	0		15		Percentage to increase production output. Valid values: 0 - 100 
EffectIncreaseCommerce	f	f	f	1
	0		15		Percentage to increase gold output. Valid values: 0 - 100 
EffectIncreaseHappiness	f	f	f	1
	0		1		Amount to raise Happiness in all cities 
EffectEliminateDistancePenalty	f	f	f	1
	0		1		Amount to reduce Distance to Capital penalty 
EffectIncreaseBoatVision	f	f	f	1
	0		1		Amount to increase vision radius of naval vessels 
EffectIncreaseScience	f	f	f	1
	0		15		Percentage to increase science output. Valid values: 0 - 100 
EffectGiveMaps		f	f	f	0	Comment
EffectIncreaseHitPoints	f	f	f	1
	0		10		Amount to increase unit hit points 
EffectScriptedTurn	f	f	f	1
	0		""		Name of SlicObject to be run each turn Feat is in effect 
EffectScriptedCity	f	f	f	1
	0		""		Name of SlicObject to be run on each city in the empire 

ExcludeAdvance		f	f	t	1
	0		ADVANCE_	Advances that exclude this Feat. Any number of Advances can be defined. Must be valid Advance ID from Advance.txt 
ExcludeWonder		f	f	t	1
	0		WONDER_		Wonders that exclude this Feat. Any number of Wonders can be defined. Must be valid Wonder ID from Wonder.txt 
ExcludeFeat		f	f	t	1
	0		FEAT_		Feats that exclude this Feat. Any number of Feats can be defined. Must be valid Feat ID from Feat.txt 
ExcludeFunction		f	f	f	1
	0		""		Name of SlicObject to exclude this Feat. The SlicObject will be run each turn and if it returns TRUE then the Feat will be excluded. 

CancelAdvance		f	f	t	1
	0		ADVANCE_	Advances that can obsolete this Feat. Any number of Advances can be defined. Must be valid Advance ID from Advance.txt 
CancelWonder		f	f	t	1
	0		WONDER_		Wonders that can obsolete this Feat. Any number of Wonders can be defined. Must be valid Wonder ID from Wonder.txt 
CancelFeat		f	f	t	1
	0		FEAT_		Feats that can obsolete this Feat. Any number of Feats can be defined. Must be valid Feat ID from Feat.txt 
CancelFunction		f	f	f	1
	0		""		Name of SlicObject that can obsolete this Feat. The SlicObject will be run each turn and if it returns TRUE then the Feat will be obsoleted. 

Building		f	f	f	1
	*featbuild.ces	0		Structure that defines type and number of buildings that must be built to trigger this Feat 
MinimumSizeOfCiv		f	f	f	1
	0		0		Minimum number of cities that must exist in nation for this feat to be accomplishable 
SlicMessage		t	t	f	1
	0		""		Name of SlicObject that defined the message box to be displayed when Feat is accomplished. 
@ //End of fields

